WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
[Silent concept film. A shield appears on a cream grid.]
The real test is the work.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.400
[A fictional workplace inbox opens and three messages arrive.]
When everything happens at once.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.100
You make the call.
Delegate. Communicate. Prioritize.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.000
Not just a score.
A fictional evidence report connects decisions to findings.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
[The SkillChain shield returns.]
Show how you work.
